v 3
d cre. Correlated random effects by joint projection, with support diagnostics and inference for multiway panels
d
d cre is a prefix command that builds Mundlak controls spanning the joint projection of the
d regressors onto the fixed-effect span, for any number of dimensions and any support, and
d wraps any estimation command. For a wrapped regress it provides the variance estimators for
d the joint-projection slope and the test of no correlated effects of Harrison, Canavire
d Bacarreza, Jacho-Chavez and Rios-Avila (2026), together with the support diagnostics their
d theory depends on.
d
d Requires: reghdfe, ftools
d
d Authors: Fernando Rios-Avila, Gustavo Canavire Bacarreza, Benjamin O. Harrison, David Jacho-Chavez
d Distribution-Date: 20260907
d
